{"h":3396,"lines":[{"h":0.01453488398216074,"t":"C","x":0.055555556042315948,"y":0.70203488344496623,"c":1,"w":0.020576130549112961},{"x":0.80846946399987907,"w":0.082831350962320971,"h":0.016115955806592974,"t":"Reading","c":1,"y":0.031375825449796668},{"y":0.078273096446318302,"c":1,"w":0.48803695678710934,"h":0.022492031326563522,"t":"Attitudes towards Artificial Intelligence","x":0.22821211587054621},{"w":0.76965835571289065,"x":0.098718077366875059,"h":0.020024354662855903,"t":"Artificial intelligence (AI) can already predict the future. Police forces are using it","y":0.11769466519622263,"c":1},{"y":0.13808139518820561,"w":0.78806584676106772,"t":"to map when and where crime is likely to occur. Doctors can use it to predict when a","x":0.098765430480705824,"h":0.017441860778592888,"c":1},{"w":0.78189300537109374,"y":0.15694935239646135,"t":"patient is most likely to have a heart attack or stroke. Researchers are even trying to","x":0.098765438137498329,"c":1,"h":0.017469251675375497},{"w":0.60493825276692703,"y":0.17726737340257026,"h":0.017500068610632802,"c":1,"t":"give Al imagination so it can plan for unexpected consequences.","x":0.098765441384686875},{"h":0.018963828384525261,"c":1,"w":0.76954732259114578,"t":"Many decisions in our lives require a good forecast, and Al is almost always better","x":0.10082304643972027,"y":0.21366279108612174},{"h":0.020096411553372717,"x":0.098688795013409936,"w":0.77587076822916656,"c":1,"t":"at forecasting than we are. Yet for all these technological advances, we still seem to","y":0.23172937778057789},{"t":"deeply lack confidence in AI predictions. Recent cases show that people don't like","c":1,"y":0.25145348876006679,"x":0.10082305556093313,"h":0.018895348053517669,"w":0.76543207804361968},{"w":0.75329177856445306,"h":0.023324869827611949,"t":"relying on Al and prefer to trust human experts, even if these experts are wrong.","c":1,"y":0.269278653351538,"x":0.098647829662018668},{"t":"If we want Al to really benefit people, we need to find a way to get people to trust","x":0.098765434237962774,"h":0.017667844522968323,"y":0.30800942276772569,"c":1,"w":0.7633744812011718},{"t":"it. To do that, we need to understand why people are so reluctant to trust AI in the","y":0.32389794354905566,"c":1,"w":0.75949086507161456,"x":0.10070244600306485,"h":0.022560663301896877},{"h":0.017874673904041516,"t":"first place.","w":0.10097134272257487,"x":0.10074889637295371,"c":1,"y":0.34716731418141467},{"t":"Take the case of Watson for Oncology, one of technology giant IBM's","y":0.3749999998353335,"w":0.65020573933919268,"c":1,"h":0.01752061248527681,"x":0.10082305633863409},{"t":"supercomputer programs. Their attempt to promote this program to cancer doctors","y":0.39298834923540116,"w":0.76976486206054695,"c":1,"h":0.020885359693331718,"x":0.10070196853342347},{"t":"was a PR disaster. The AI promised to deliver top-quality recommendations on","x":0.10068672245006061,"w":0.73483032226562495,"h":0.022544541825113673,"y":0.41047624932947469,"c":1},{"t":"the treatment of 12 cancers that accounted for 80% of the world's cases. But when","h":0.020274397060362936,"x":0.10071826637957741,"c":1,"w":0.76768458048502597,"y":0.43153800646235174},{"w":0.73479665120442705,"x":0.10072026534470666,"y":0.45025454262282372,"h":0.022174313997913364,"c":1,"t":"doctors first interacted with Watson, they found themselves in a rather difficult"},{"h":0.017667844522968212,"x":0.10082303477006131,"c":1,"t":"situation. On the one hand, if Watson provided guidance about a treatment that","y":0.47084805633786353,"w":0.73456792195638021},{"t":"coincided with their own opinions, physicians did not see much point in Watson's","y":0.48932007367334429,"w":0.76148015340169262,"x":0.10074264447572186,"h":0.020354467511036534,"c":1},{"h":0.020419881256786399,"t":"recommendations. The supercomputer was simply telling them what they already","y":0.50854302765407722,"w":0.75941909790039075,"c":1,"x":0.10074228779866369},{"c":1,"t":"knew, and these recommendations did not change the actual treatment.","y":0.52704199027305898,"x":0.10070033945863173,"w":0.6627632141113281,"h":0.022679905166895664},{"w":0.73892303466796871,"t":"On the other hand, if Watson generated a recommendation that contradicted the","x":0.10276575478242619,"c":1,"y":0.55574268560842099,"h":0.022006018001704652},{"h":0.023569304754933462,"x":0.10076577458665847,"t":"experts' opinion, doctors would typically conclude that Watson wasn't competent.","y":0.57392936311062781,"w":0.76762685139973952,"c":1},{"y":0.59593023239558729,"c":1,"w":0.71810699462890626,"t":"And the machine wouldn't be able to explain why its treatment was plausible","x":0.1028806590895249,"h":0.017441860778592888},{"h":0.01922670101529711,"t":"because its machine-learning algorithms were simply too complex to be fully","y":0.61449924150334267,"w":0.7223361206054687,"c":1,"x":0.10077254703670122},{"y":0.63204960741978033,"c":1,"x":0.10270738695888099,"t":"understood by humans. Consequently, this has caused even more suspicion","w":0.69787368774414071,"h":0.023411729450922292},{"h":0.018979236571331048,"c":1,"x":0.10288065467761376,"y":0.65253239093789506,"t":"and disbelief, leading many doctors to ignore the seemingly outlandish AI","w":0.69135803222656245},{"x":0.1008230491538004,"t":"recommendations and stick to their own expertise.","h":0.017667844522968212,"y":0.67285041234078091,"w":0.47530863444010424,"c":1},{"h":0.025220676642284223,"x":0.098612798420358277,"c":1,"y":0.69661212584228627,"w":0.78427825927734363,"t":"This is just one example of people's lack of confidence in AI and their reluctance to"},{"t":"accept what Al has to offer. Trust in other people is often based on our understanding","w":0.7923296101888021,"h":0.020154541878312782,"c":1,"y":0.71939359426871319,"x":0.10280538580396752},{"y":0.737771202146282,"t":"of how others think and having experience of their reliability. This helps create","w":0.73684122721354162,"h":0.020931619075779562,"x":0.10276373314020569,"c":1},{"t":"a psychological feeling of safety. Al, on the other hand, is still fairly new and","w":0.72034662882486977,"c":1,"y":0.75800443497113712,"x":0.10278624772099666,"h":0.020740746047668068},{"w":0.75122172037760404,"t":"unfamiliar to most people. Even if it can be technically explained (and that's not","h":0.020699986299440698,"c":1,"x":0.10278374137988985,"y":0.77664507611829137},{"w":0.734871317545573,"x":0.10272110866882438,"y":0.79426983247873506,"t":"always the case), Al's decision-making process is usually too difficult for most","c":1,"h":0.023669742723516629},{"t":"people to comprehend. And interacting with something we don't understand can","c":1,"x":0.10481741371280577,"y":0.81524175238290564,"w":0.74713643391927087,"h":0.022229278887961001},{"x":0.10493827214907772,"y":0.83863368662097004,"h":0.017470964694612845,"t":"cause anxiety and give us a sense that we're losing control.","w":0.55144032796223963,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"91","x":0.87037037048288313,"y":0.90552325563693892,"h":0.013081395583944722,"w":0.024691357612609877},{"t":"IELTSXpress.com","h":0.027004518273019973,"y":0.9556315279170291,"w":0.25425661722819015,"c":1,"x":0.71953327191129191}],"w":2400}